<p>Everything PrimeSol said is correct, except for one minor thing. The object is not necessarily linked to a single deity, it can be used with essentially any of them.</p>
<p>Soul energy is not explicitly different from other kinds of energy, not even when offering. Making an explosion happen is very different from an offering though, because it's like doing something in a god's name versus directly offering them a gift.</p>
<p>As for the locked box test, I thought it was a good compromise to establish that if people are actively trying to take the thing out of the locked box, it fits in with the containment risk of the object.</p>

